{"searchSupport.getOrCreateIndex performs a check-then-build without per-key synchronization, and bleveBackend.BuildIndex no longer serializes index creation across goroutines, allowing multiple BuildIndex calls to race for the same NamespacedResource": 0.894811749458313, "bleveBackend.TotalDocs iterates over b.cache without holding cacheMu while BuildIndex writes to b.cache under cacheMu, which can panic with 'concurrent map iteration and map write' during metrics collection": 0.9452843070030212, "In BuildIndex, IndexTenants metric is incremented immediately after calling bleve.New() or bleve.NewMemOnly(), before checking if those calls returned an error, causing incorrect metrics when index creation fails": 0.5439966917037964, "The integration test now unconditionally skips when GRAFANA_TEST_DB=postgres, reducing CI coverage for the Postgres path and potentially hiding regressions in the storage server target": 0.7731093168258667}